SUMMARY:RAD WITCHES\, Femme Comedy in The RAD
DESCRIPTION:Queers to the Front!\nModelface Comedy Club brings the best co
 medians from all over the country to Asheville\, NC. This week we are exci
 ted to have a very spooky all femme show!\n\nWe are celebrating the most h
 aunting time of year with some truly RAD Women! Join some of the best femm
 e comedians from Asheville and beyond for a night of unforgettable laughs 
 at The RAD Brew Co. in the River Arts District!\n\nages 18+\nDoors at 6:30
 pm\, show at 7pm\nTickets $18
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/queers-to-the-front/events/316786431/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260930T214209Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260930T214209Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Queers to the Front!
UID:event_316143193@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261024T043046Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261104T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261104T210000
SUMMARY:Everybody But You Bro Comedy Open Mic
DESCRIPTION:Queers to the Front!\nJoin Eyes Up Here Comedy & Modelface Com
 edy for the premiere open mic for the rest of us -- Everybody But You Bro 
 is a comedy mic for women\, non-binary\, queer and femme folks to take the
  stage and tell jokes -- up to 5 minutes.\n\nThis is a queer and trans-inc
 lusive mic.\nWe don’t punch down y’all!\n\nSign ups at 6pm and shows s
 tarts at 6:30pm and it’s show up and go up! Located in the Comedy Baseme
 nt at The RAD Brew Co.\nAll are welcome for the audience\, however heckler
 s will be asked to leave\n\nFree event\, Suggested $10 donations are highl
 y encouraged\nHosted by Erin Terry\, Danny Felix and Linda Barsi\nStick ar
 ound after the mic for our Joke Writing Workshop at 8pm
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/queers-to-the-front/events/316143193/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260816T172517Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260816T172517Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
